{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05801","headline":"程将军夫人挽诗 · 徐安贞","name":"程将军夫人挽诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"琴瑟调双凤，和鸣不独飞。\n正歌春可乐，行泣露先曦。\n环佩声犹在，房栊梦不归。\n将军休沐日，谁劝着新衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐安贞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05801.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05801","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}